# fb-sim image needs only the host source. Everything else (jsbsim, vendor, build, the WASM app in
# web/, the engine sources) is irrelevant to the container and would bloat the build context.
# (A file cannot be re-included while its parent dir stays excluded, so un-ignore src/clients/ first.)
*
!src
src/*
!src/clients
src/clients/*
!src/clients/FBSimHost.cpp
